        'InnoDB includes built-in **Inverted Full-Text Indexes (`FULLTEXT`)** supporting BM25-style **Natural Language ranking**, **Boolean operators (`+must -exclude "exact phrase" prefix*`)**, and **`ngram` tokenization**.',
